The contribution is the three causal helper splits at charts 498, 480 and 595 on the #7708 circuit, together with their search, exact builder and checks. All code here is newly written, and predecessor packages were read as data only.

aliromman supplied the relay-cut recodings (PR #7708) and the banked-transfer circuit (PR #7674). Clear1nsight supplied the role-1256 relay (PR #7704), the chart-595 split method (PR #7697) and the role-230 reroute (PR #7682). SYLforge supplied the cf6a nine-swap word (PR #7700) and the signed sixteen-call caller. DreamingOfClouds, Rohan Arun, Jerry Chen (CubeJerry), Douglas Colkitt and the authors credited in the inherited notices supplied predecessor constructions, the selected framework and the repository infrastructure.

The exact predecessor notices are in `credits/`. `source/` holds the #7700 word and the 16-call caller as published with #7704. `ASSETS.json` binds every package file.
